      "id": "n42-coefficients",
      "source_numbers": ["851"],
      "view": {
        "mode": "single",
        "stem": "For each equation as written, identify $a,b,c$ in $ax^2+bx+c=0$. Which complete table is correct?\n\n| Equation | |\n|---|---|\n| P | $2x^2+17x+3=0$ |\n| Q | $5x^2-9x+4=0$ |\n| R | $x^2-12x-6=0$ |\n| S | $-x^2+x-2=0$ |\n| T | $8x^2-7x=0$ |\n| U | $x^2-81=0$ |",
