            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "c",
            "text": "| Equation | $a$ | $b$ | $c$ |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| P | $2$ | $3$ | $17$ |\n| Q | $5$ | $4$ | $-9$ |\n| R | $1$ | $-6$ | $-12$ |\n| S | $-1$ | $-2$ | $1$ |\n| T | $8$ | $0$ | $-7$ |\n| U | $1$ | $-81$ | $0$ |",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "d",
            "text": "| Equation | $a$ | $b$ | $c$ |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| P | $1$ | $17/2$ | $3/2$ |\n| Q | $1$ | $-9/5$ | $4/5$ |\n| R | $1$ | $-12$ | $-6$ |\n| S | $1$ | $-1$ | $2$ |\n| T | $1$ | $-7/8$ | $0$ |\n| U | $1$ | $0$ | $-81$ |",
