      "view": {
        "mode": "single",
        "stem": "Use the graphs of $P:y=x^2$ and $L:y=x+2$ to solve $x^2=x+2$, $x^2<x+2$, and $x^2>x+2$. Which table gives all real $x$ values for equal heights, $P$ below $L$, and $P$ above $L$? Both graphs continue beyond the frame.",
