        "stem": "Solve these equations graphically using the corresponding frames A-F. In each frame the solid curve is $y=x^2$; the dashed line is the other function obtained from the equation. Which complete table gives the real roots? Approximate roots within $0.05$ are acceptable. The functions continue beyond each frame.\n\n| Frame | Equation |\n|---|---|\n| A | $x^2+3x-4=0$ |\n| B | $x^2-2x-5=0$ |\n| C | $x^2+2x+5=0$ |\n| D | $2x^2-x-3=0$ |\n| E | $3x^2+2x-5=0$ |\n| F | $5x^2+12x-10=0$ |",
